commit-author Guenter Roeck <linux@roeck-us.net>
commit d1e720c7328e046049b792d03fae093d4d3a72e4
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-6.12.0-211.56.1.el10_2/d1e720c7.failed

Add support for guard() and scoped_guard() for the hwmon subsystem lock
to simplify its use.

	Signed-off-by: Guenter Roeck <linux@roeck-us.net>
(cherry picked from commit d1e720c7328e046049b792d03fae093d4d3a72e4)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

